{"2994190": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Money Simulator", "steam_appid": 2994190, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DISCOVER WAYS TO MAKE MONEY !</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival doesn’t come cheap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamble, trade &amp; mine crypto assets, complete deliveries, join street races, or find side hustles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every method has its risk  but sometimes risk is the only way out. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994190/extras/aaa080efabb4ea2311a44441582d6404.poster.avif?t=1786533415\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994190/extras/aaa080efabb4ea2311a44441582d6404.webm?t=1786533415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994190/extras/aaa080efabb4ea2311a44441582d6404.mp4?t=1786533415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER THE ART OF VEHICLE TRADING !</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buy, repair, customize, and resell vehicles for profit.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smart investments and sharp deals make all the difference in Brokeville.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994190/extras/fd83c8bba1f7c64a53a8b014f623c7b1.poster.avif?t=1786533415\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994190/extras/fd83c8bba1f7c64a53a8b014f623c7b1.webm?t=1786533415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994190/extras/fd83c8bba1f7c64a53a8b014f623c7b1.mp4?t=1786533415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SHOW YOUR STYLE !</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your outfit, buy your dream vehicle, shape your vibe, and stand out in the chaos of Brokeville !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival’s important, but looking cool matters too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994190/extras/c9ebc6cc51a023550d77ec9d00c848ed.poster.avif?t=1786533415\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994190/extras/c9ebc6cc51a023550d77ec9d00c848ed.webm?t=1786533415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994190/extras/c9ebc6cc51a023550d77ec9d00c848ed.mp4?t=1786533415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD AND MANAGE YOUR OWN SHOP !</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Success starts with a dusty little shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your business type, organize your shelves, keep things clean, and manage your staff.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything’s under your control  prices, customer flow, and occasionally... the trash. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994190/extras/a75ab6f0a99daa31bf78931b6d4de10e.poster.avif?t=1786533415\" widt